{
  "title": "94: al-Sharh (Insherah) الشرح",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful\nاَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَدْرَكَۙ‏(1)\nALAM NASHRAH LAKA SADRAKA.\nDid We not open your breast for you\nوَوَضَعْنَا عَنْكَ وِزْرَكَۙ‏(2)\nWA WAZA’NAA A’NKA WIZRAKAL.\nand relieve you of your burden\nالَّذِىْۤ اَنْقَضَ ظَهْرَكَۙ‏(3)\nLAZEE ANQAZA ZAHRAKA.\nwhich [almost] broke your back?\nوَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَؕ‏(4)\nWA RA-FA’NAA LAKA ZIKRAK.\nDid We not exalt your name?\nفَاِنَّ مَعَ الْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا ۙ‏(5)\nFA-INNA MA-A’L U’SRE YUSRAN.\nIndeed ease accompanies hardship.\nاِنَّ مَعَ الْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا ؕ‏(6)\nINNA MA-A’L U’SRE YUSRAA.\nIndeed ease accompanies hardship.\nفَاِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَانْصَبْۙ‏(7)\nFA-EZAA FARAGHTA FAN-SAB.\nSo when you are done, appoint,\nوَاِلٰى رَبِّكَ فَارْغَب‏(8)\nWA ELAA RABBEKA FAR-GHAB.\nand supplicate your Lord.",
  "merits": "This Surah has 8 verses and it is ‘Makki’. The Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) said that Allah (s.w.t.) grants good fortune and Yaqeen (certitude) in religion, to the person who recites this Surah.\nRecitation of this Surah is also good for relieving chest pains. Drinking water in which this Surah has been dissolved is a cure for problems while urination and heart ailments."
